{"_id":"eqr0000000000001","name":"Barbarian","type":"race","img":"systems/eqrmss/assets/Icons/race/barbarian.png","system":{"description":"<h3>Barbarian</h3><p><strong>Stat Modifiers:</strong> St: +12, Co: +8, Ag: -2, Qu: -4, SD: +4, Re: -4, Me: -4, In: 0, Em: -2, Pr: +2</p><p><strong>Resistances:</strong> Poison/Disease: +15, Cold: +30</p><p><strong>Racial Traits:</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Cold Resistance:</strong> Immune to natural cold, +30 to cold spells.</li><li><strong>Slam:</strong> Can perform shield/body bash attacks with bonus knockdown potential.</li></ul>"}}
{"_id":"eqr0000000000002","name":"Dark Elf (Teir'Dal)","type":"race","img":"systems/eqrmss/assets/Icons/race/dark-elf.png","system":{"description":"<h3>Dark Elf (Teir'Dal)</h3><p><strong>Stat Modifiers:</strong> St: -4, Co: -2, Ag: +8, Qu: +8, SD: -2, Re: +4, Me: +4, In: +2, Em: -4, Pr: -4</p><p><strong>Resistances:</strong> Essence: +15</p><p><strong>Racial Traits:</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Ultravision:</strong> See perfectly in total darkness.</li><li><strong>Hide:</strong> +15 to Stealth (Hide) skill.</li></ul>"}}
{"_id":"eqr0000000000003","name":"Dwarf","type":"race","img":"systems/eqrmss/assets/Icons/race/dwarf.png","system":{"description":"<h3>Dwarf</h3><p><strong>Stat Modifiers:</strong> St: +10, Co: +12, Ag: -2, Qu: -2, SD: +6, Re: -2, Me: -2, In: 0, Em: -2, Pr: 0</p><p><strong>Resistances:</strong> Essence: +20, Poison/Disease: +20</p><p><strong>Racial Traits:</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Stonevision:</strong> See in dark underground settings.</li><li><strong>Dwarven Stature:</strong> Highly resistant to knockdowns, increased carrying capacity.</li></ul>"}}
{"_id":"eqr0000000000004","name":"Erudite","type":"race","img":"systems/eqrmss/assets/Icons/race/erudite.png","system":{"description":"<h3>Erudite</h3><p><strong>Stat Modifiers:</strong> St: -6, Co: -4, Ag: 0, Qu: 0, SD: +4, Re: +12, Me: +12, In: +4, Em: +2, Pr: +8</p><p><strong>Resistances:</strong> Essence: +25, Poison/Disease: -10</p><p><strong>Racial Traits:</strong></p><ul><li><strong>High Magic Resistance:</strong> Extremely high defense against spell effects.</li><li><strong>Fragile Constitution:</strong> Susceptible to poisons, diseases, and physical exhaustion.</li></ul>"}}
{"_id":"eqr0000000000005","name":"Gnome","type":"race","img":"systems/eqrmss/assets/Icons/race/gnome.png","system":{"description":"<h3>Gnome</h3><p><strong>Stat Modifiers:</strong> St: -8, Co: -2, Ag: +6, Qu: +4, SD: +2, Re: +8, Me: +8, In: 0, Em: 0, Pr: -2</p><p><strong>Resistances:</strong> Essence: +10</p><p><strong>Racial Traits:</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Tinkering:</strong> +25 to crafting/tinkering skills.</li><li><strong>Infravision:</strong> Heat-based vision in the dark.</li></ul>"}}
