{"_id":"eqr0000000000010","name":"Iksar","type":"race","img":"systems/eqrmss/assets/Icons/race/iksar.png","system":{"description":"<h3>Iksar</h3><p><strong>Stat Modifiers:</strong> St: +6, Co: +4, Ag: +8, Qu: +6, SD: 0, Re: -2, Me: -2, In: 0, Em: -4, Pr: -4</p><p><strong>Resistances:</strong> Fire: +15, Cold: -15</p><p><strong>Racial Traits:</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Regeneration:</strong> Doubled natural hit point recovery rate.</li><li><strong>Scale Armor:</strong> Permanent +10 to Defense Bonus (DB).</li><li><strong>Swim:</strong> +25 to Swimming skill.</li></ul>"}}
{"_id":"eqr0000000000011","name":"Ogre","type":"race","img":"systems/eqrmss/assets/Icons/race/ogre.png","system":{"description":"<h3>Ogre</h3><p><strong>Stat Modifiers:</strong> St: +18, Co: +16, Ag: -6, Qu: -8, SD: +8, Re: -8, Me: -8, In: -4, Em: -6, Pr: -6</p><p><strong>Resistances:</strong> None</p><p><strong>Racial Traits:</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Frontal Stun Immunity:</strong> Cannot be stunned from physical frontal attacks.</li><li><strong>Slam:</strong> Powerful unarmed bash.</li></ul>"}}
{"_id":"eqr0000000000012","name":"Troll","type":"race","img":"systems/eqrmss/assets/Icons/race/troll.png","system":{"description":"<h3>Troll</h3><p><strong>Stat Modifiers:</strong> St: +14, Co: +14, Ag: -4, Qu: -4, SD: -2, Re: -8, Me: -8, In: -4, Em: -8, Pr: -10</p><p><strong>Resistances:</strong> Fire: -20</p><p><strong>Racial Traits:</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Rapid Regeneration:</strong> Tripled natural hit point recovery rate.</li><li><strong>Slam:</strong> Slam attack.</li></ul>"}}
