{"_id":"eqr0000000000015","name":"Froglok","type":"race","img":"systems/eqrmss/assets/Icons/race/froglok.png","system":{"description":"<h3>Froglok</h3><p><strong>Stat Modifiers:</strong> St: -2, Co: +4, Ag: +8, Qu: +8, SD: +2, Re: 0, Me: 0, In: +6, Em: 0, Pr: -2</p><p><strong>Resistances:</strong> Poison/Disease: +10, Water/Frost: +20</p><p><strong>Racial Traits:</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Amphibious Swim:</strong> +30 to Swimming skill, can breathe underwater.</li><li><strong>Ultravision:</strong> See perfectly in total darkness.</li><li><strong>Jumping:</strong> +15 to Acrobatics/Athletics for jumping checks.</li></ul>"}}
